        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūbiza ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenīlo ū Daūdi ūmūja ū SEEBA, “Naje kū nzengo gūmò gwaho ū mu sī ya Yuda?” Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Jaga.” Ū Daūdi ūbūūja hangī, “Halī ūko naje?” Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Jaga Hebuloni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi ūja ko ng'hana, na a bake bakwe a babīlī, ū Ahinoamu wa Yezileeli nū Abigaili ūyo walī nke o ng'wa Nabaali muna Kalimeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūbasola na a banhū abo bajaga hose hose hamò nang'hwe; būlī ng'wene na kaya yakwe, ūja nabo būūkabiza bikaji ba kū mizengo ya Hebuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū ba Yuda biza ī Hebuloni, būng'witīīla maguta ū Daūdi gīkī abize ntemi wa numba ya Yuda. Aho bang'winha ī mhola ū Daūdi gīkī a bana Yabeshi-gileadi hū bene abo bakanjīka ū Saulo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūbatūmīla nhūng'wa a banhū ba Yabeshi-gileadi; ūbawīla, “Ū SEEBA ang'wīlūkīle a bing'we kūlwa nguno ya kūng'wītīla ū wiza wenūbo ū sīng'we būgonzo ū Saulo, ng'ūnjīka na kūnjīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū SEEBA leki ang'olekeje wiza na būtogwa būtaale; nū nene nakūng'olekeja wiza bo mbika yenīyo kūlwa nguno ng'wagwītile ū mhayo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, īmagi hīgīyī na mubize bashisha ng'holò; nguno a banhū ba numba ya Yuda banītile ū nene kūbiza ntemi wabo, aho waacha ū sīng'we būgonzo ū Saulo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ishi-boshesi kūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo ū Abuneeli, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Neeli, ūyo walī ntaale wa mabità ga ng'wa Saulo, ūsangwa wansolile ū Ishi-boshesi ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Saulo, ūntwala Mahanaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūūkang'wīta kūbiza ntemi wa banhū ba Gileadi, Ashuli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ashuli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū Asheli.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yezileeli, na a banhū ba Efulaimu, Benjamini nī Isilaeli ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ishi-boshesi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Saulo aho alītūūlwa kūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli walī na myaka makūmi anè, ūsuga ikanza lya myaka ībīlī. Alīyo ī numba ya ng'wa Yuda ī yene yūnondeela Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza ī lyose īlo walī Hebuloni ū Daūdi aho alī ntemi wa Yuda, lyalī myaka mpungatī na myeji ītandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abuneeli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Neeli ūbūūka ī Mahanaimu kūja Gibeoni, hamò na banhū ba ng'wa Ishi-bosheti ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu ng'wana Seluya nang'hwe ūja koi na banhū ba ng'wa Daūdi; būūkamanhīja kwilambo lya Gibeoni. Ibità līmò ligasha kū lwandī ūlū ū lwilambo lyenīlo, nī libità ī līngī ligasha ū kū lwandī ū lūngī; gikimaalīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ū Abuneeli wang'wīla ū Yoabu, “Ni babūkage a bayanda bigushe tūlole!” Yoabu nang'hwe ūzunya alīhaya, “Būgatū ni babūkage.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbūūka ng'hana, būbalwa ikūmi na babīlī a ba lwandī lwa Benjamini, ū kūlī Ishi-boshesi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Saulo; na a ba lwandī lwa ng'wa Daūdi ikūmi na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būlī ng'wene ūndima ū ng'wilwisha wakwe kū ntwe, na kūnchima lūshū ū mu lūbazu kūshisha lūlibīla; a bose būgwa hasī! Na lūūlū ī lipandī lya henaho ī Gibeoni litanwa Helikati-hazulimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Helikati-hazulimu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, lūbūūga lwa shū, nūūlū ipandī lya wanishi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būlūgū wa lūshikū lwenūlo būkabiza būkalī no; ū Abuneeli na a banhū bakwe a Baisilaeli būpyenwa na a banhū ba ng'wa Daūdi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abuneeli Kūmūlaga Asaheli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wana Seluya baalīho hoi būdatū wabo, ū Yoabu, Abishai nū Asaheli. Ū Asaheli ū ng'wene walī mpeeji no, gītī laala ya kū matogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wisonja ū Abuneeli; atagalūkile kū būlyo nūūlū kū lūmoso aho alīmpeeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abuneeli aho wikībūka ū kū numa ūmona ū Asaheli, ūbūūja; “Gashinaga ūlī bebe Asaheli?” Sūmba nang'hwe ūshosha, “Nene ng'hana!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abuneeli ūng'wīla, “Galūkaga kū nkono gwa būlyo nūūlū gwa lūmoso, ūnsole ūmò wa bayanda ūntaagīje ng'wenūyo ī shilanga shakwe.” Alīyo ū Asaheli atalekile ū kūng'widomha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abuneeli ūng'hūgūla hangī ū Asaheli, “Bebe lekaga ū kūniidomha gīko ū nene; nibūlī ūnenheleje kūkūbūlaga? Ī gīsī nakwilola kinehe nū nkūlūyo ū Yoabu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Asaheli atazunije ūkūleka ū kūmpeeja ū Abuneeli; nose ū Abuneeli ūlīponya ī lichimu lyakwe lyūkantūla munda ū Asaheli, lyūntūlīla kū someke yalyo lyūpulung'hanya kū ngongo. Ūgwa ūchīla henaho; būlī munhū ūyūshika wīma aho akagwīla ū Asaheli ūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yoabu nū Abishai būng'wisonja ū Abuneeli; ī līīmi aho lyayūlengeela kūhaya kūlibīla, būshika kū ngūlya gwa Ama, bbihī na Gia, kwikūūwa lya kūja kwitogolo lya Gibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū ba Benjamini bibilinga hamò, kūlondeela būtongeeji bo ng'wa Abuneeli; būbeeja ibità bīmīīla ha ka ngūlya kalebe, bīma nyagosha kwilwīlīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abuneeli ūng'hīlīka ū Yoabu ūng'wīla, “Ī līlūshū līkwikala līkūlyaga banhū ilalī? Ūtamanile gīkī ū mhayo gwenūyū ū kū ng'halīlo yaho būkūbiza ho būpīna būtaale? A banhū bako bakūbakūūbīja a badūgū babo kūshisha nanalī hū ūbawīle booye?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu ūhaya, “Nalīkwilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa Mulungu mpanga gīkī, ūlū ni ūtahayile mhayo, a bagosha beneba ni babakūūbīlīja a badūgū babo kūshisha kwela ū būjikū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yoabu wīlīja ī ndūūlilū yakwe, pye a banhū bīma booya ū kūbakūūbīlīja a Baisilaeli; nū būlūgū batalwile hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būjikū wenūbo bose ū Abuneeli na a banhū bakwe būshimīza kūlītīna ī litogolo lya Alaba. Būūkagūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani, būshimīza ī likanza lya līīmi lya dilū ī lyose, kūshisha būshika Mahanaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu nang'hwe ūshoka ū kūfuma ū kūnkūūbīja ū Abuneeli, wiza kūbakuminga a banhū bakwe. Aho babalwa yūmanika gīkī a banhū ba ng'wa Daūdi abo bakabiza batīho baalī ikūmi na kenda, kūleka kūng'wisaaba ū Asaheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū ba ng'wa Daūdi baalī babūlaga banhū magana adatū na makūmi atandatū a ba Benjamini, abo baalī nū Abuneeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnsola ū Asaheli būūkanjīka Betelehemu mu shigila sha ng'wa ise. Hūna ū Yoabu na a banhū bakwe būshoka Hebuloni, būkeeyula bakūshimīzaga; būūkashika ko būleela ū būjikū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
